docs/v0.8-design.md-2-
docs/v0.8-design.md-3-Status: draft
docs/v0.8-design.md-4-Date: 2026-06-17
docs/v0.8-design.md-5-Author: Ivan Oparin
docs/v0.8-design.md-6-Target: v0.8.0
docs/v0.8-design.md-7-
docs/v0.8-design.md-8-RFC 0005 shipped the deterministic audit foundation: capability manifests,
docs/v0.8-design.md:9:static detectors, verdict cache, trust pins, revocations, and the shared
docs/v0.8-design.md-10-`gate_plans` install gate. v0.8.0 adds real extractor backends on top of that
docs/v0.8-design.md-11-foundation without changing the deterministic policy layer.
docs/v0.8-design.md-12-
docs/v0.8-design.md-13-The key rule stays unchanged: backends detect and report findings. They do not
docs/v0.8-design.md-14-decide whether a skill installs. The gate remains deterministic and local to
docs/v0.8-design.md-15-`csk`.
docs/v0.8-design.md-16-
docs/v0.8-design.md-17-## 1. Goals
--
docs/v0.8-design.md-23-- Keep v0.8 local-first: no cloud egress unless `audit.allow_cloud` and the
docs/v0.8-design.md-24-  selected backend both explicitly allow it.
docs/v0.8-design.md-25-- Redact file contents before they are sent to a cloud-capable backend.
docs/v0.8-design.md-26-- Keep local backends useful by allowing raw file bytes for local-only analysis.
docs/v0.8-design.md-27-- Move backend timeout from a hardcoded `30` seconds into typed audit backend
docs/v0.8-design.md-28-  config.
docs/v0.8-design.md-29-- Exercise fail-open and fail-closed behavior with real backend failures, not
docs/v0.8-design.md-30-  only mocked exceptions.
docs/v0.8-design.md:31:- Preserve v0.7 semantics for `null` backend, static detectors, cache, pins, and
docs/v0.8-design.md-32-  revocations.
docs/v0.8-design.md-33-
docs/v0.8-design.md-34-## 2. Non-Goals
docs/v0.8-design.md-35-
docs/v0.8-design.md-36-- Adding Claude Code backend. It remains a later RFC.
docs/v0.8-design.md-37-- Adding remote service APIs or OpenAI SDK integration. v0.8 uses external
docs/v0.8-design.md-38-  processes only.
docs/v0.8-design.md-39-- Letting a backend decide install policy. Backends only emit findings.
--
docs/v0.8-design.md-63-## 4. Existing Foundation Reused
