docs/v0.8-design.md-69-| `Finding` model | Stable | Backend findings use the same model |
docs/v0.8-design.md-70-| `gate_plans` | Project and global install gate | Unchanged policy semantics |
docs/v0.8-design.md:71:| Verdict cache | Keyed by hash/backend/model/prompt/ruleset | Backend identity and timeout do not affect hash, only backend/model/prompt/ruleset |
