docs/audit-design.md-321-  applied to the file bytes in the request, not only to `evidence`. If scrubbing
docs/audit-design.md-322-  changed any file, the request carries `redacted=True` and a `redaction`
docs/audit-design.md-323-  finding is added so the auditor knows content was altered (a secret that was
docs/audit-design.md-324-  removed cannot be analyzed as a capability).
