docs/audit-design.md-627-   with the `null` (static-only) backend, the static detectors, `csk audit`
docs/audit-design.md:628:   standalone, `csk install --audit` advisory, the verdict cache and trust
docs/audit-design.md-629-   records (TOFU/pins/grants/revocation data model). Deterministic, zero egress,
docs/audit-design.md-630-   no LLM. The seam for LLM is present and exercised by `null`.
docs/audit-design.md-631-2. v0.8.0 — LLM extractor backends: `command` (generic) and `codex` (local-first),
docs/audit-design.md-632-   backend canaries, timeout plumbing, and file-content redaction in the request
docs/audit-design.md-633-   path. Detailed in RFC 0006 (`docs/v0.8-design.md`).
