"""Rooted no-follow POSIX storage for immutable csk build-cache entries.

The live physical layout is deliberately csk-specific and non-portable::

    <manager-home>/builds/go-v1/<64-hex-key>/
        csk-receipt.ccj.json
        bin/<command>

