+# TASK-260720-2jfnz6 rework tool readiness
+
+- `git --version`: exit 0, git 2.50.1
+- `rg --version`: exit 0, ripgrep 15.2.0
+- `/Users/iv/Developer/Wildberries/cocoaskills/.venv/bin/python --version`: exit 0, Python 3.14.4
+- `python -m pytest --version`: exit 0, pytest 9.0.3
+- `python -m mypy --version`: exit 0, mypy 2.1.0
+- `python -m build --version`: exit 0, build 1.5.0
+- `gh --version`: exit 0, GitHub CLI 2.83.2
+- `gh run view 30514706010`: exit 0; confirmed four Ubuntu jobs failed while macOS, Windows, and strict mypy passed.
+- `gh api repos/ivanopcode/cocoaskills/actions/jobs/90781846662/logs`: exit 0; confirmed four POSIX cache failures at `_move_aside` with `PermissionError: [Errno 13]`.
+- Docker, Podman, and Colima are unavailable locally (each readiness command exited 127), so Linux behavior is covered deterministically in the regression test and will be rechecked by the GitHub Ubuntu matrix after integration.
diff --git a//Users/iv/Developer/Wildberries/cocoaskills/.temp/TASK-260720-2jfnz6/worktree/tests/test_build_cache_posix.py b//Users/iv/Developer/Wildberries/cocoaskills/.temp/TASK-260720-2jfnz6/worktree/tests/test_build_cache_posix.py
