+### 2026-07-30 — Protected POSIX cache Linux quarantine CI rework
+- TRIGGER: CocoaSkills PR #11 CI run `30514706010` passed strict mypy plus every macOS and Windows test job, but all four Ubuntu versions failed the same four cache tests at `_move_aside` with `PermissionError: [Errno 13]`.
+- ROOT CAUSE: the verified temporary owner-unlock path was gated to Darwin. Linux therefore attempted ordinary quarantine rename with sealed directory modes `0500`, `0550`, or `0000`; owner write/execute control was absent at the rename boundary.
