+     `cocoaskills-0.12.6.dev7+g0d6ad16fc.d20260730.tar.gz` and
+     `cocoaskills-0.12.6.dev7+g0d6ad16fc.d20260730-py3-none-any.whl`.
+   - `python -m twine check` on those exact two artifacts — exit 0; both
